Blake runs back and forth 15 times. He runs 100 yards * 2 = 200 yards. Kelly runs back and forth 34 times to the 40-yard line and back. She runs 34 * 80 = 2720 yards. Blake runs 200 yards, and Kelly runs 2720 yards. Kelly runs 2720 - 200 = 2520 yards farther than Blake.

{id 157}: {"answers": {"157": 2520}}

